  data: {
    LLM: "Always aim for 31 by collecting the Ace and two 10-value cards of the same suit. If you have 30.5 (three of a kind), it is a very strong defensive hand.\n\nClosing the round (Knocking) is a power move. Only do it if you have 25+ points and think others have much less.\n\nWatch what others take from the 'Window'. If an opponent takes a Rose, don't lead Roses unless you are dumping high cards you don't need.",
